  #standard-article(
  title: [Comparing k-NN in Rust],
  author: [Huon Wilson],
  source-name: [Huon Wilson],
  images: (),
  paragraphs: (
  [In my voyages around the internet, I came across a pair of
 blog posts which compare the implementation of a
 k -nearest neighbour ( k -NN) classifier in F\# and OCaml. I couldn’t
resist writing the code into Rust to see how it fared.],
  [Rust is a memory-safe systems language under heavy development; this
code compiles with the latest nightly (as of 2014-06-10 12:00 UTC),
